   "en": "The Gemara answers: «When we do not give him time» to pay «compensation» it is specifically «with regard to injury, as he caused a monetary loss» by inflicting physical damage on the victim. «But with regard to humiliation, where he did not cause him a monetary loss, we do give» him time to pay compensation."
